{"index": 8, "ok": true, "item": {"kind": "text", "content": "<p><b>渐进修正：扁平风。</b>初稿出现细发丝、精细针织和二次元柔和阴影，不符合扁平；随后减少材质纹理，换成整块发形和硬边色块，最终图已列于上文。</p>"}, "result": {"ok": true, "identity": "user", "data": {"document": {"revision_id": 19, "url": "https://lcnqs3974j2m.feishu.cn/docx/ZZfkdTmMwoXuZMxswYHcqYRinkd"}, "result": "success", "warnings": []}}}
