{"index": 32, "ok": true, "item": {"kind": "text", "content": "<h2>第二轮渐进过程：先识别漂移，再定点修正</h2><p>以下是实际保留的过程稿，不作为合格交付。每次仅针对暴露的问题修正，保留原图以便比较。</p>"}, "result": {"ok": true, "identity": "user", "data": {"document": {"revision_id": 64, "url": "https://lcnqs3974j2m.feishu.cn/docx/ZZfkdTmMwoXuZMxswYHcqYRinkd"}, "result": "success", "warnings": []}}}
{"index": 33, "ok": true, "item": {"kind": "text", "content": "<p>5初稿：照片权重过高，偏真人棚拍；下一步将手办参考置前，要求雕塑发束、无毛孔喷涂皮肤与6.5头身。</p>"}, "result": {"ok": true, "identity": "user", "data": {"document": {"revision_id": 65, "url": "https://lcnqs3974j2m.feishu.cn/docx/ZZfkdTmMwoXuZMxswYHcqYRinkd"}, "result": "success", "warnings": []}}}
