{"index": 35, "ok": true, "item": {"kind": "text", "content": "<p>6初稿：黏土方向变成写实皮肤与衣料；下一步加强哑光粗发束和简化鼻嘴。</p>"}, "result": {"ok": true, "identity": "user", "data": {"document": {"revision_id": 68, "url": "https://lcnqs3974j2m.feishu.cn/docx/ZZfkdTmMwoXuZMxswYHcqYRinkd"}, "result": "success", "warnings": []}}}
