{"index": 37, "ok": true, "item": {"kind": "text", "content": "<p>6中间稿：眼型偏通用动漫且刘海擦眼；下一步用正脸与笑脸重新约束平眉杏眼、卧蚕圆下巴，并露出眼睛。</p>"}, "result": {"ok": true, "identity": "user", "data": {"document": {"revision_id": 71, "url": "https://lcnqs3974j2m.feishu.cn/docx/ZZfkdTmMwoXuZMxswYHcqYRinkd"}, "result": "success", "warnings": []}}}
