{"index": 39, "ok": true, "item": {"kind": "text", "content": "<p>7初稿：潮玩变为真人时装；下一步改为哑光软胶雕塑与约4.8头身。</p>"}, "result": {"ok": true, "identity": "user", "data": {"document": {"revision_id": 74, "url": "https://lcnqs3974j2m.feishu.cn/docx/ZZfkdTmMwoXuZMxswYHcqYRinkd"}, "result": "success", "warnings": []}}}
